---
import news from '../../../data/eyuf/news.json';
import sources from '../../../data/eyuf/sources.json';
const registry = new Map(sources.items.map(s => [s.id, s]));
const today = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-CA', { timeZone: 'Asia/Tashkent' }).format(new Date());
const current = news.items.filter(item => item.status === 'current' && (!item.archive_on || item.archive_on > today));
const archived = news.items.filter(item => !current.includes(item));
---
<section class="eyuf-panel" aria-labelledby="yangilik-h">
 <h2 id="yangilik-h">Sanali islohotlar va yangiliklar</h2>
 <p>Har xabar e’lon qilingan sanasiga bog‘langan. Loyiha, rejalashtirilgan chora va olingan natijani ajrating. Karta ro‘yxati har nashrda tekshiriladi.</p>
 {current.length === 0 && <p>Joriy kartalar uchun yangi manba ko‘rigi kutilmoqda. Oldingi xabarlar quyida tarixiy misol sifatida saqlangan.</p>}
 {current.map(item => <article><h3>{item.title}</h3><p><time datetime={item.published_on}>{item.published_on}</time> · Manba ko‘rilgan {item.as_of}</p><p>{item.body}</p><ul>{item.sources.map(ref => <li><a href={registry.get(ref.id)?.url ?? undefined} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{ref.id} · {ref.locator} (yangi oynada)</a></li>)}</ul></article>)}
 <details><summary>Tarixiy xabarlar arxivi</summary>{archived.map(item => <article><h3>{item.title}</h3><p><time datetime={item.published_on}>{item.published_on}</time> · Arxiv</p><p>{item.body}</p><ul>{item.sources.map(ref => <li><a href={registry.get(ref.id)?.url ?? undefined} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{ref.id} · {ref.locator} (yangi oynada)</a></li>)}</ul></article>)}</details>
</section>
<style>
article { border-top: var(--border-width-1) solid var(--color-border); padding-block: var(--space-4); }
article h3 { margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
</style>
